The {{Term/Store|Climbing Gear|Climbing Gear|Series, BotW, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Climbing Gear is a piece of [[Armor]] located in [[Chaas Qeta Shrine]] on [[Tenoko Island]]. After obtaining it, [[Granté]] will begin selling the piece of Armor for 4,000 [[Rupee]]s. According to its description, it is infused with ancient technology.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, it provides one level of [[Climb Speed Up]]. The Climbing Gear can be [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Climbing Gear, alongside the [[Climber's Bandanna]] and the [[Climbing Boots]], compose the [[Climbing Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been Enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a [[Climb Jump Stamina Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

